@page "/routes"

<PageTitle>Arcs &amp; routes - Blazor-ApexMaps</PageTitle>

<h1>Arcs &amp; routes</h1>

<p class="lead">
    An arc derives the great circle between two endpoints. A line series draws the path it is
    given. Both can send beads along themselves, so a connection reads as a direction.
</p>

<div class="demo-toolbar">
    <div class="form-check form-switch">
        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="geodesic" checked="@_geodesic"
               @onchange="e => Set(() => _geodesic = (bool?)e.Value ?? false)" />
        <label class="form-check-label" for="geodesic">Geodesic</label>
    </div>
    <div class="form-check form-switch">
        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="flow" checked="@_flow"
               @onchange="e => Set(() => _flow = (bool?)e.Value ?? false)" />
        <label class="form-check-label" for="flow">Flow beads</label>
    </div>
    <label>
        Curvature
        <input class="form-range" type="range" min="0" max="0.6" step="0.05" value="@_curvature"
               @onchange="e => Set(() => _curvature = double.TryParse(e.Value?.ToString(), out var v) ? v : 0)" />
    </label>
</div>

<div class="demo-card">
    <ApexMaps Options="_arcOptions" Height="480" />
</div>

<p class="text-muted small">
    Geodesic is on by default and it matters: a straight line between Singapore and London in
    Mercator is not the route a plane flies, and naive straight lines break at the antimeridian.
    Curvature bulges the arc off that path, so it is decorative rather than geographic and off by
    default. Beads travel from <code>From</code> towards <code>To</code>, staggered per route so a
    corridor reads as traffic rather than one synchronised pulse; reduced motion leaves them in
    place and stops them moving, because a dotted route still reads as a route.
</p>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">Routes through given vertices</h2>

<div class="demo-card">
    <ApexMaps Options="_lineOptions" Height="440" />
</div>

<p class="text-muted small">
    Two ways from Rotterdam to Singapore, each drawn through its own waypoints: a GPS trace, a
    shipping lane or a transit line is a path, not a pair of endpoints.
</p>

@code {
    private bool _geodesic = true;
    private bool _flow = true;
    private double _curvature;

    private MapsOptions _arcOptions = null!;
    private MapsOptions _lineOptions = null!;

    protected override void OnInitialized() => Rebuild();

    private void Set(Action change)
    {
        change();
        Rebuild();
    }

    private void Rebuild()
    {
        _arcOptions = new MapsOptions
        {
            Geo = new GeoOptions
            {
                Map = GeoMaps.WorldCountries110m,
                Fill = "#e5e7eb",
                View = new ViewOptions { Fit = ViewFitMode.World, Padding = 16 },
            },
            Series =
            [
                new ArcSeries
                {
                    Name = "Weekly seats",
                    Data = SampleData.Flights,
                    Geodesic = _geodesic,
                    Curvature = _curvature > 0 ? _curvature : null,
                    Width = new SizeOptions { Range = [1, 6] },
                    ColorScale = new ScaleOptions { Palette = Palettes.Magma, Reverse = true },
                    Endpoints = new EndpointOptions { Show = true, Radius = 3 },
                    Flow = _flow ? new FlowOptions { Speed = 80, Spacing = 48 } : null,
                    Opacity = 0.85,
                },
            ],
            Legend = new LegendOptions { Position = LegendPosition.Bottom, Title = "Weekly seats" },
            Tooltip = new TooltipOptions
            {
                Formatter = JsFunction.From(
                    "ctx => `<b>${ctx.name}</b><br>${(ctx.value ?? 0).toLocaleString()} seats/week`"),
            },
        };

        _lineOptions = new MapsOptions
        {
            Geo = new GeoOptions
            {
                Map = GeoMaps.WorldCountries110m,
                Fill = "#eef2f7",
                View = new ViewOptions { Fit = new GeoBounds(-25, -45, 115, 62), Padding = 20 },
            },
            Series =
            [
                new LineSeries
                {
                    Name = "Shipping lanes",
                    Data = SampleData.ShippingLanes,
                    Width = new SizeOptions { Range = [2, 5] },
                    Color = "#7c3aed",
                    Endpoints = new EndpointOptions { Show = true, Radius = 4 },
                    Flow = _flow ? new FlowOptions { Style = FlowStyle.Dots, Speed = 60 } : null,
                },
            ],
            Legend = new LegendOptions { Show = false },
            Tooltip = new TooltipOptions { Formatter = JsFunction.From("ctx => `<b>${ctx.name}</b>`") },
        };
    }
}
